        "era_note": "Appearance interval 1991-07-31 to 1993-01-19 exclusive is accepted for illustration only, not office tenure or eligibility. Source date: 1992-04-07. Commons' structured date field gives 1992-04 (month). The Commons descriptions of this file, its parent and the album give the day: '1992年4月7日、迎賓館にて、田辺誠・日本社会党委員長' (7 April 1992, at the State Guest House; parent category 'Asahi no Ma'), consistent with Jiang Zemin's April 1992 official visit. The day was not checked against the 97 MB album PDF (not downloaded; MOFA's site refuses non-browser clients). Either reading lies inside the window. Tanabe was born on 25 February 1922 (general biographical knowledge, not C01 research). He is 70 in the photograph of 7 April 1992 and 69 to 70 across the window (1991-07-31 to 1993-01-18 inclusive). The photograph is inside the window, 251 days after its start and 287 days before its exclusive end, so no age adjustment is needed. It is a chest-up crop: the rest of the body, trousers, shoes, standing pose and both hands are artistic extensions, and the lapel badge is omitted on purpose. The 581x774 scan is heavily sharpened and grainy, with a warm cast; the prompt asks for natural skin tones. No historical holder, office boundary or chronology is changed.",
